   Input Rows: 7
   Output Rows: 7
   ->  Custom Scan (PgBatchScan) on pg_batch_test (actual rows=7.00 loops=1)
         Batch Size: 64
         Batch Source: Heap
         Batches: 2
         Source Rows: 80
         Filter Datums: 80
         Projection Datums: 7
         Restarted Projection Datums: 0
(12 rows)

