         Input Rows: 84
         Output Rows: 84
         ->  Custom Scan (PgBatchScan) on pg_batch_arrow (actual rows=84.00 loops=1)
               Batch Size: 64
               Batch Source: Compressed Arrow
               Compressed Path: Direct
               Compressed Scan Mode: batch
               Batches: 3
               Source Rows: 130
               Filter Datums: 0
               Projection Datums: 0
